SUMMARY:[Threads] Reference picture: "Example painting 6"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 6 (stage in-progress\, Replace these exa
 mple rows with Anna's real works. Stages: idea\, in-progress\, finished\, 
 listed\, sold\, archived. Dates: started\, finished\, listed\, drop\, sold
 .)\nWHY: Let people in at the start. The photo\, the sketch\, the thing th
 at caught your eye. By the time the painting is finished they feel they we
 re there.\nSHOT: The reference photo or sketchbook page / Reference next t
 o the blank or just-started canvas\nCAPTION: What caught you about this. O
 ne or two sentences. Not what it is\, what it is about.\nASK: Ask a questi
 on people can answer with one word.\nFORMAT (Threads): Text up to 500 char
 s\, 1-10 images\, or video under 5 min. Lead with a line that stands alone
 . Post the image\, say one true thing\, ask one question.\nTIME: about 5 m
 in\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
