DTSTAMP:20261030T000000Z
DTSTART:20261030T140000Z
DTEND:20261030T141000Z
SUMMARY:[Instagram (Story)] Work in progress: "Example painting 6"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 6 (stage in-progress\, Replace these exa
 mple rows with Anna's real works. Stages: idea\, in-progress\, finished\, 
 listed\, sold\, archived. Dates: started\, finished\, listed\, drop\, sold
 .)\nWHY: The most reliable post there is. People love watching a thing get
  made. With a painting every 3 days\, there is always one on the easel.\nS
 HOT: Canvas on the easel\, phone photo\, natural light / Detail crop of th
 e part you worked on today / Palette and brushes next to the canvas\nCAPTI
 ON: Where it is at today. One sentence on what is working or what is fight
 ing you.\nASK: Ask whether to push it further or stop.\nFORMAT (Instagram)
 : Feed 4:5 (1080x1350). Reels 9:16 up to 90s\, hook in the first second\, 
 captions on. Stories daily\, 15s each\, raw is fine.\nTIME: about 10 min\n
 \nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
CATEGORIES:Instagram,post
URL:https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:[Instagram (Story)] Work in progress: "Example painting 6"
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
