SUMMARY:[Facebook] Finished work: "Example painting 4"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 4 (stage finished\, drop 2026-10-24\, pr
 ints)\nWHY: The payoff post. Shoot it properly. This image gets reused for
  the for-sale post\, the prints\, the newsletter\, the video.\nSHOT: Strai
 ght on\, even daylight\, no glare\, cropped to the edges / One shot in a r
 oom or leaning on a wall for scale / One tight detail\nCAPTION: Title\, si
 ze\, medium. One line about what it ended up being about. Whether it is av
 ailable.\nASK: DM to collect / link in bio / prints coming.\nFORMAT (Faceb
 ook): Same image or video as Instagram. Longer captions are fine here\, pe
 ople read. Always put the price and how to buy in the post.\nTIME: about 2
 0 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
CATEGORIES:Facebook,post
URL:https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:[Facebook] Finished work: "Example painting 4"
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
