UID:2026-10-30:noon-post:threads@studio-days
DTSTAMP:20261030T000000Z
DTSTART:20261030T163000Z
DTEND:20261030T164500Z
SUMMARY:[Threads] The story behind it: "Example painting 3"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 3 (stage listed)\nWHY: The why. This is 
 the post that turns a liker into a buyer. Text does the work\, the image j
 ust needs to be there.\nSHOT: The finished piece\, or a detail of it\nCAPT
 ION: Where the idea came from\, what happened while making it\, what it me
 ans now. 3-6 sentences. Honest beats clever.\nASK: If this one speaks to y
 ou\, it is available. Link.\nFORMAT (Threads): Text up to 500 chars\, 1-10
  images\, or video under 5 min. Lead with a line that stands alone. Post t
 he image\, say one true thing\, ask one question.\nTIME: about 15 min\n\nO
 pen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
CATEGORIES:Threads,post
URL:https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:[Threads] The story behind it: "Example painting 3"
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
