UID:2026-10-30:yt-short:youtube@studio-days
DTSTAMP:20261030T000000Z
DTSTART:20261030T210000Z
DTEND:20261030T213000Z
SUMMARY:[YouTube (Short)] Painting video: "Example painting 5"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 5 (stage finished)\nWHY: Reach. Video of
  the painting being made\, or a slow pan over the finished surface\, is ho
 w strangers find the work. Record once\, post to four platforms.\nSHOT: Ph
 one on a tripod\, 9:16\, over the shoulder or straight on / 10-20 min of r
 eal painting cut to the best 20-45s / Or: slow pan across the finished pai
 nting\, ending on a pull-back of the whole thing\nCAPTION: On-screen text 
 or voiceover: what you were thinking during this part. Keep it human.\nASK
 : Follow to see it finished / link to buy.\nFORMAT (YouTube): Shorts 9:16 
 under 60s\, same as TikTok. Talking videos 2-6 min\, 16:9 or 9:16\, phone 
 at eye level\, window light\, title says what you talk about.\nTIME: about
  30 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
CATEGORIES:YouTube,post
URL:https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:[YouTube (Short)] Painting video: "Example painting 5"
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
