UID:2026-10-30:tt-talk:tiktok@studio-days
DTSTAMP:20261030T000000Z
DTSTART:20261030T220000Z
DTEND:20261030T224000Z
SUMMARY:[TikTok] Talking to camera: "Example painting 5"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 5 (stage finished)\nWHY: This is what bu
 ilds a fan base. People buy from a person they feel they know. One idea pe
 r video: why this painting\, what you learned\, an answer to a comment.\nS
 HOT: Phone at eye level\, window light\, the painting behind you / 30-90s 
 for Shorts/TikTok\, or 2-6 min for YouTube / Start mid-thought\, no intro\
 nCAPTION: The one idea\, as the title. Example: 'Why I painted this twice'
 .\nASK: Ask them to tell you which painting they would hang.\nFORMAT (TikT
 ok): 9:16 vertical\, 15-60s. First frame is the most interesting moment\, 
 not a logo. Voiceover or on-screen text with what you were thinking.\nTIME
 : about 40 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
CATEGORIES:TikTok,post
URL:https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:[TikTok] Talking to camera: "Example painting 5"
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
