SUMMARY:[Substack] Newsletter
DESCRIPTION:WHY: Weekly. The people on the list are the people who buy. Two
  paintings finished this week\, so there is always something to show.\nSHO
 T: The best images from the week: this week's finished pieces\, one WIP\nC
 APTION: What got made\, what is for sale\, what is coming\, one story. Und
 er 300 words.\nASK: One link to what is for sale.\nFORMAT (Substack): Unde
 r 300 words. Two or three images. One story. One link to what is for sale.
  Subject line under 6 words.\nTIME: about 45 min\n\nOpen the app: https://
 brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
