DTSTAMP:20261030T000000Z
DTSTART:20261101T173000Z
DTEND:20261101T174500Z
SUMMARY:[Threads] Prints announcement: "Example painting 1"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 1 (stage sold\, prints)\nWHY: Most peopl
 e cannot buy the original. Prints turn the audience into customers at a pr
 ice that works for them. Sold originals are the best print candidates.\nSH
 OT: The print in a frame on a real wall / Hands holding the print / Close-
 up of the paper texture\nCAPTION: Prints of [title] are up. Sizes. Paper. 
 How many\, if limited.\nASK: Link to the shop.\nFORMAT (Threads): Text up 
 to 500 chars\, 1-10 images\, or video under 5 min. Lead with a line that s
 tands alone. Post the image\, say one true thing\, ask one question.\nTIME
 : about 15 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
CATEGORIES:Threads,post
URL:https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:[Threads] Prints announcement: "Example painting 1"
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
