DTSTART:20261101T220000Z
DTEND:20261101T223000Z
SUMMARY:[Studio ops] Weekly review and plan
DESCRIPTION:WHY: Look at what performed this week. Move works through the p
 ipeline. Set next week's drop dates. Then stop thinking about it until nex
 t Sunday.\nCAPTION: Open the Pipeline tab. Update each work's stage and da
 tes. Check each painting's coverage row for gaps. Note the top 3 posts of 
 the week and why.\nTIME: about 30 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.g
 ithub.io/anna-studio/
CATEGORIES:Studio ops,ritual
URL:https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
