 iece in a room for scale / The piece straight on\nCAPTION: Title\, size\, 
 price\, shipping\, how to buy. One line about it. That is all.\nASK: DM me
  / link in bio. Say which.\nFORMAT (Threads): Text up to 500 chars\, 1-10 
 images\, or video under 5 min. Lead with a line that stands alone. Post th
 e image\, say one true thing\, ask one question.\nTIME: about 10 min\n\nOp
