SUMMARY:[TikTok] Painting video: "Example painting 2"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 2 (stage listed\, prints)\nWHY: Reach. V
 ideo of the painting being made\, or a slow pan over the finished surface\
 , is how strangers find the work. Record once\, post to four platforms.\nS
 HOT: Phone on a tripod\, 9:16\, over the shoulder or straight on / 10-20 m
 in of real painting cut to the best 20-45s / Or: slow pan across the finis
 hed painting\, ending on a pull-back of the whole thing\nCAPTION: On-scree
 n text or voiceover: what you were thinking during this part. Keep it huma
 n.\nASK: Follow to see it finished / link to buy.\nFORMAT (TikTok): 9:16 v
 ertical\, 15-60s. First frame is the most interesting moment\, not a logo.
  Voiceover or on-screen text with what you were thinking.\nTIME: about 30 
 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
CATEGORIES:TikTok,post
URL:https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
