SUMMARY:[Facebook] Prints announcement: "Example painting 1"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 1 (stage sold\, prints)\nWHY: Most peopl
 e cannot buy the original. Prints turn the audience into customers at a pr
 ice that works for them. Sold originals are the best print candidates.\nSH
 OT: The print in a frame on a real wall / Hands holding the print / Close-
 up of the paper texture\nCAPTION: Prints of [title] are up. Sizes. Paper. 
 How many\, if limited.\nASK: Link to the shop.\nFORMAT (Facebook): Same im
 age or video as Instagram. Longer captions are fine here\, people read. Al
 ways put the price and how to buy in the post.\nTIME: about 15 min\n\nOpen
  the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
