SUMMARY:[Facebook] Work for sale: "Example painting 3"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 3 (stage listed)\nWHY: Say it is for sal
 e\, plainly\, with a price. Most people never buy because they were never 
 asked. Every listed painting gets this post\, more than once.\nSHOT: The p
 iece in a room for scale / The piece straight on\nCAPTION: Title\, size\, 
 price\, shipping\, how to buy. One line about it. That is all.\nASK: DM me
  / link in bio. Say which.\nFORMAT (Facebook): Same image or video as Inst
 agram. Longer captions are fine here\, people read. Always put the price a
 nd how to buy in the post.\nTIME: about 10 min\n\nOpen the app: https://br
 ianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
