  print in a frame on a real wall / Hands holding the print / Close-up of t
 he paper texture\nCAPTION: Prints of [title] are up. Sizes. Paper. How man
 y\, if limited.\nASK: Link to the shop.\nFORMAT (Threads): Text up to 500 
 chars\, 1-10 images\, or video under 5 min. Lead with a line that stands a
 lone. Post the image\, say one true thing\, ask one question.\nTIME: about
  15 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
