 he painting being made\, or a slow pan over the finished surface\, is how 
 strangers find the work. Record once\, post to four platforms.\nSHOT: Phon
 e on a tripod\, 9:16\, over the shoulder or straight on / 10-20 min of rea
 l painting cut to the best 20-45s / Or: slow pan across the finished paint
 ing\, ending on a pull-back of the whole thing\nCAPTION: On-screen text or
  voiceover: what you were thinking during this part. Keep it human.\nASK: 
