 er 300 words.\nASK: One link to what is for sale.\nFORMAT (Substack): Unde
 r 300 words. Two or three images. One story. One link to what is for sale.
  Subject line under 6 words.\nTIME: about 45 min\n\nOpen the app: https://
 brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
