 in of real painting cut to the best 20-45s / Or: slow pan across the finis
 hed painting\, ending on a pull-back of the whole thing\nCAPTION: On-scree
 n text or voiceover: what you were thinking during this part. Keep it huma
 n.\nASK: Follow to see it finished / link to buy.\nTIME: about 60 min\n\nO
 pen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
