 , size\, price\, shipping\, how to buy. One line about it. That is all.\nA
 SK: DM me / link in bio. Say which.\nFORMAT (Instagram): Feed 4:5 (1080x13
 50). Reels 9:16 up to 90s\, hook in the first second\, captions on. Storie
 s daily\, 15s each\, raw is fine.\nTIME: about 10 min\n\nOpen the app: htt
